# neptune-admin-fe

Next 16 App Router `src/`, React 19, TS strict, Tailwind v4 (`globals.css` `@theme`), RQ + axios, Iconify/sonner/recharts/libphonenumber-js. Alias `@/*`→`./src/*`. React Compiler: skip gratuitous memo.

- `components/inputs/` form controls
- `components/ui/` Button, Table, Modal, ConfirmDialog, cards, menus
- `components/layouts/` PageHeader, DashboardHeader, DashboardSidebar
- `utils/` `lib/` `providers/` `types/` · `public/sidebar/` Figma assets

Named exports; barrel `index.ts`. `"use client"` only if needed. Tokens: `blue-normal`, `darkest`, `gray`, `lightgray`, `green`/`red`/`yellow`. Glass: `bg-white/62`, `rounded-[20px]`, existing dual shadows. Read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before new Next APIs.
